  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to your bonded ally runs stronger than most.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Share Spells<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The range of your share spells is increased by 5 feet per mythic tier before your bonded creature loses the benefit of spells it shares with you. In addition you may target your bonded creature with touch spells (including shared spells) at a range of 5 feet per mythic tier. When you use a spell-trigger or spell-completion item to produce a spell effect, you can expend one use of your mythic power to share that spell effect with your bonded creature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
